### 签名验证测试（POST）
### 注意：Authorization 头需要通过Client 客户端动态生成
### 以下仅为格式示例，实际使用时需要替换为有效的签名值
POST http://localhost:8080/sign/verify
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Host: localhost:8080
X-Timestamp: 1551113065
Authorization: HMAC-SHA256 AccessKeyId=xxxxxxxx, SignedHeaders=content-type;host, Signature=替换为实际签名值

{"data":"hello, signature!"}

### 签名验证测试（GET）
### 注意：Authorization 头需要通过Client 客户端动态生成
GET http://localhost:8080/sign/verify
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Host: localhost:8080
X-Timestamp: 1551113065
Authorization: HMAC-SHA256 AccessKeyId=xxxxxxxx, SignedHeaders=content-type;host, Signature=替换为实际签名值
